OL,3,GNEWSA'Huge' need for more hosts for
OL,4,AUkrainian families
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn organisation supporting Ukrainians
OL,7,Fin the UK said there was a "huge" need
OL,8,Ffor more volunteers to host people
OL,9,Ffleeing Russia's full-scale invasion of
OL,10,FUkraine, which began four and a half
OL,11,Fyears ago.
OL,13,FSwindon Welcomes Ukrainians (SWU) said
OL,14,Fthe town had already welcomed more than
OL,15,F500 people since 2022 through the Homes
OL,16,Ffor Ukraine scheme.
OL,18,FBut SWU vice-chair, Kris Talikowski,
OL,19,Fsaid there had never been "a more
OL,20,Fpressing time" for people who had not
OL,21,Fpreviously hosted to put themselves
OL,22,Fforward.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
